      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The average itself can reveal that ratio. For boy average 78, girl average 68 and class average 74:\n\nBoys:girls = (74−68):(78−74) = 6:4 = 3:2.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
