      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Capstone: three groups can be handled one ratio at a time.\n\nGroup X averages 80, Y averages 50, and X+Y together average 70.\n\nSo X:Y = (70−50):(80−70) = 20:10 = 2:1.",
